# AcornOS's known gaps under Ginux. Format: one `gap NAME REASON` line per
# service that recab's boot-health verdict lists as failed; `#` lines are
# comments. A run passes when the failed services are exactly these: a listed
# gap that no longer fails fails the run too, so remove its line.
#
# Not yet re-recorded since the shared staging (the product's own runlevels,
# a network for every instance) and the recab verdict.
gap networking  needs the hostname service; sethostname is ENOSYS under Ginux
